  "description": "Four source geometric figures in the original 2-by-2 order: segment AB; hatched quadrilateral ABCD; hatched rectangle with C, K above B, M; and two open sides BA/BC with truncated hatching and no closing edge. Modern regularization only: Latin subpart letters and clean unmeasured sizes/hatch spacing. No endpoint dots, arrows, numerical lengths, square/equal-length givens, or answers are added.",
